-.TH ORBIT 1 "September 2026" "orbit-app 1.0.0" "User Commands"
-.SH NAME
-orbit \- list planets
-.SH SYNOPSIS
-.B orbit
-.BR --format " json|table"
-.SH DESCRIPTION
-The development server listens on port 3000 by default.
-Run npm run dev after npm install. Run npm test to verify the app.
-Set PORT to change the port and ORBIT_GREETING to change the home-page text.
-.SH OPTIONS
-.TP
-.B --format
-Print the planets as json or table. The default is table.
